tr><td style=\"width:143.21pt;height:24.14pt;padding:1.41pt 5.10pt 1.41pt 5.10pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.28pt;border-left:solid #000000 1.13pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 0.28pt;border-right:solid #000000 0.85pt;\" valign=\"middle\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;\">학술대회 참가 교통비</span></p></td><td style=\"width:290.97pt;height:24.14pt;padding:1.41pt 5.10pt 1.41pt 5.10pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.28pt;border-left:solid #000000 0.85pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 0.28pt;border-right:solid #000000 0.85pt;\" valign=\"middle\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 14.4pt; text-indent: -14.4pt; text-align: left; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-hansi-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.4pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">■ </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.4pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">AX</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;letter-spacing:-0.4pt;\">교수학습센터를 통해 학술대회 참가비 사전 신청을 완료한 학생에 한해 교통비 지급</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width:143.21pt;height:24.14pt;padding:1.41pt 5.10pt 1.41pt 5.10pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.28pt;border-left:solid #000000 1.13pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 0.28pt;border-right:solid #000000 0.85pt;\" valign=\"middle\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;\">학술대회 발표 장려금</span></p></td><td style=\"width:290.97pt;height:24.14pt;padding:1.41pt 5.10pt 1.41pt 5.10pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.28pt;border-left:solid #000000 0.85pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 0.28pt;border-right:solid #000000 0.85pt;\" valign=\"middle\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.4pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">-</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width:143.21pt;height:24.14pt;padding:1.41pt 5.10pt 1.41pt 5.10pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.28pt;border-left:solid #000000 1.13pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 1.13pt;border-right:solid #000000 0.85pt;\" valign=\"middle\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;\">논문 게재 장려금</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">(SCI</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;\">급 포함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">)</span></p></td><td style=\"width:290.97pt;height:24.14pt;padding:1.41pt 5.10pt 1.41pt 5.10pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.28pt;border-left:solid #000000 0.85pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 1.13pt;border-right:solid #000000 0.85pt;\" valign=\"middle\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.4pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">-</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 5pt 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 24px; word-break: break-all;\"><br></p><div style=\"color: rgb(32, 33, 36); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">한국정보기술학회에서 진행하는 추계종합학술대회 및 대학생논문경진대회 (11.26~28 메종글래드제주)의 경우</div><div style=\"color: rgb(32, 33, 36); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">10/23(금)까지 학회에 논문을 제출하고 10/29（목）까지 학부(과)로 학술대회 참가비 지원 신청 하시기 바랍니다.</div><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 5pt 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 24px; word-break: break-all;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 5pt 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 24px; word-break: break-all;\">문의사항: AX교수학습센터(054-478-7356)</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
